From 3eae36bf0625df7392e02e4db1ecd079f654de13 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: jr31415 <jacob@rosen4.com>
Date: Sat, 10 Oct 2026 13:22:15 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 11/11] Input: apply between scheduler rounds, optional present
 thread, latency probe

- drain input every round (threaded) / audio chunk (single thread), not only
  at the frame boundary
- NDS_PRESENT_THREAD=1: vsync'd present on its own thread; main thread only
  pumps events (SDL_WaitEventTimeout 1 ms)
- input_latency debug command + NDS_INPUT_TEST_PRESSES self-injection
- adaptive audio floor starts at 768 and decays (cold boot underran at 192)

Measured pickup-to-guest: 8.5 ms mean / 16.7 ms max -> 0.5 ms / 2.0 ms.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
